# Never commit anything that could hold a real secret/token.
# This project stores credentials only in environment variables (JIRA_PAT,
# JIRA_BASE_URL) — never in files — but this list is a safety net in case
# that ever changes or someone adds a local override file.

.env
.env.*
*.env
*secret*
*token*
*credentials*
*.pat
local.settings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Sample.json

# The prep/ folder's scripts are safe to commit (no secrets inside them) —
# but never let a stray copy of the local secrets file end up here.
secrets.env
**/secrets.env
prep/secrets.env
**/.jira-daily/
!prep/secrets.env.example

# Common local override / scratch files
*.local.ps1
*.local.json
notes.md
